<article class="bl-privacy-content bl-prose"><h2>Who this website represents</h2><p>bobliftloader.com is the compact equipment business website of Xuzhou BOB-LIFT Construction Machinery Co., Ltd. Contact the company at <a href="mailto:info@boblift.com">info@boblift.com</a>.</p><h2>How the enquiry form works</h2><p>The form prepares an email draft on your device. You can review your product choice and contact details before opening your email application. Nothing is sent by pressing “Prepare enquiry”; you choose whether to send the email from your email application.</p><h2>Your information</h2><p>Form entries are used to prepare the draft and are not stored in a website database by this form. When you send an email, the company receives the information you include and can use it to respond to your enquiry. Your email provider’s own privacy terms also apply.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Links to WhatsApp, the main BOB-LIFT website and other BOB-LIFT product sources take you to those services. This website does not use advertising or analytics tracking.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have sent, contact <a href="mailto:info@boblift.com">info@boblift.com</a> and identify the enquiry concerned.</p></article>
